{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MIRRORLIGHT</strong> is a <strong>VR</strong> (Virtual Reality) game, made with love and care by the small and passionate studio <strong>Virtuous Interactive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a mysterious explorer who has fallen far from his heavenly home. The gateway you used to reach this world has been shattered, its pieces scattered across a world cloaked in darkness. To return, you must solve light-based puzzles, save imprisoned creatures and overcome the robotic inhabitants who guard the fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recover the fragments. Restore the gateway. Return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in environmental interactions, exploration, and light-based puzzle solving and combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665570?t=1746512310","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665570/0a1561eb570da94f4d8fcc7f6ddccd50bb2f3f0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746512310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665570/a3f45556045be2696e767d82bce9f895abe1c0d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746512310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665570/a3f45556045be2696e767d82bce9f895abe1c0d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746512310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MIRRORLIGHT</strong> is a <strong>VR</strong> (Virtual Reality) game, made with love and care by the small and passionate studio <strong>Virtuous Interactive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a mysterious explorer who has fallen far from his heavenly home. The gateway you used to reach this world has been shattered, its pieces scattered across a world cloaked in darkness. To return, you must solve light-based puzzles, save imprisoned creatures and overcome the robotic inhabitants who guard the fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recover the fragments. Restore the gateway. Return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in environmental interactions, exploration, and light-based puzzle solving and combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Virtuous Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665570/958106631f11bbe3ae1b220587a25b58741e51b8/header.jpg?t=1746512310","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135298,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135298/movie480.mp4?t=1746465200","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135298/movie_max.mp4?t=1746465200"},"name":"Early GAMEPLAY Footage - Please Wishlist!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135298/0e656bbd03c6f5076d910e3899f3d1c3d7f11258/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746465200","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135298/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746465200","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135298/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746465200"}}],"name":"MIRRORLIGHT","package_groups":[],"pc_r